# Build context for deploy/guard/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).
# An allow list: only the workspace sources and prebuilt release binaries are sent, so .env,
# data, reports and research folders can never end up in a build context or an image layer.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md
!crates/
!deploy/guard/rules/
!tests/redteam/
!dist/linux-*/zunder-guard
**/target
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.key
**/*.pem
